flowchart TB
    pair[Adjacent query-order pair A then B]
    pair --> sameRef{Same reference_name?}
    sameRef -- No --> TRA[Translocation BND]
    sameRef -- Yes --> sameStrand{Same strand?}
    sameStrand -- No --> INV[Inversion]
    sameStrand -- Yes --> orderRef{B starts before A ends on ref?}
    orderRef -- yes --> DUP[Tandem duplication]
    orderRef -- no --> sizes{ref gap vs query gap}
    sizes -- ref_gap >> query_gap --> DEL[Deletion]
    sizes -- query_gap >> ref_gap --> INS[Unaligned insertion]
    sizes -- both small --> CLEAN[Clean split no event]
